{"logId": "701854ed-b9b8-4b50-a7ee-6496a2e06870", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（六）在公司连续工龄满七年以上的男、女员工（一胎），从孩子0-3岁，每月享受育儿补助费100元。", "block_bbox": [242, 105, 2126, 159], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[242.0, 105.0], [2126.0, 105.0], [2126.0, 159.0], [242.0, 159.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（七）处助以上管理人员产假后上岗保留原级别，课长及课长以下管理人员从员工做起。", "block_bbox": [242, 173, 1862, 226], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[242.0, 173.0], [1862.0, 173.0], [1862.0, 226.0], [242.0, 226.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "五、丧事礼金", "block_bbox": [155, 243, 427, 293], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[155.0, 243.0], [427.0, 243.0], [427.0, 293.0], [155.0, 293.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 在公司连续工龄满一三年的员工，父母、岳父母、公婆、配偶、子女去世，由公司送500元以示慰问。", "block_bbox": [236, 311, 2141, 363], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[236.0, 311.0], [2141.0, 311.0], [2141.0, 363.0], [236.0, 363.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 在公司工龄满三年以上送慰问金1000元。", "block_bbox": [238, 379, 1035, 430], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 379.0], [1035.0, 379.0], [1035.0, 430.0], [238.0, 430.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "六、医疗福利", "block_bbox": [154, 448, 426, 498], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[154.0, 448.0], [426.0, 448.0], [426.0, 498.0], [154.0, 498.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "1. 团体意外伤害", "block_bbox": [242, 516, 557, 566], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[242.0, 516.0], [557.0, 516.0], [557.0, 566.0], [242.0, 566.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "公司为每个员工办理团体意外伤害保险。", "block_bbox": [279, 584, 1031, 635], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[279.0, 584.0], [1031.0, 584.0], [1031.0, 635.0], [279.0, 635.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "2. 职工医疗福利", "block_bbox": [240, 653, 559, 703], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 653.0], [559.0, 653.0], [559.0, 703.0], [240.0, 703.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "员工生病在公司职工诊所看病，按成本药价收费，免费测血压、体温、脉搏检查、外科检查、免费外伤包扎等健康检查，员工家属可享受同样待遇。", "block_bbox": [154, 720, 2686, 841], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[154.0, 720.0], [2686.0, 720.0], [2686.0, 841.0], [154.0, 841.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "七、员工旅游", "block_bbox": [154, 857, 428, 909], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[154.0, 857.0], [428.0, 857.0], [428.0, 909.0], [154.0, 909.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "公司员工可享受此项福利，福利形式：各部门组织省内游，费用标准：100元/人。", "block_bbox": [238, 926, 1732, 978], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 926.0], [1732.0, 926.0], [1732.0, 978.0], [238.0, 978.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "八、困难救助", "block_bbox": [153, 994, 425, 1044], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[153.0, 994.0], [425.0, 994.0], [425.0, 1044.0], [153.0, 1044.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "公司员工如确有困难的，本人可写出书面申请，逐级上报，经公司核实后，根据情况给予救助。", "block_bbox": [237, 1062, 1996, 1114], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 1062.0], [1996.0, 1062.0], [1996.0, 1114.0], [237.0, 1114.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "九、其他", "block_bbox": [155, 1131, 341, 1181], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[155.0, 1131.0], [341.0, 1131.0], [341.0, 1181.0], [155.0, 1181.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 公司员工购买电器、服装、生活用品等，可享受优惠价购物待遇。", "block_bbox": [239, 1198, 1494, 1251], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1198.0], [1494.0, 1198.0], [1494.0, 1251.0], [239.0, 1251.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 员工在婚、产、丧期间，如需用车，公司可免费提供车辆帮助。", "block_bbox": [237, 1267, 1453, 1319], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 1267.0], [1453.0, 1267.0], [1453.0, 1319.0], [237.0, 1319.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 下级不允许给上级送礼金（结婚、生育、丧事）。", "block_bbox": [238, 1336, 1204, 1386], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1336.0], [1204.0, 1336.0], [1204.0, 1386.0], [238.0, 1386.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4. 上级给下级送礼金200元（结婚、生育、丧事）。", "block_bbox": [238, 1404, 1183, 1455], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1404.0], [1183.0, 1404.0], [1183.0, 1455.0], [238.0, 1455.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5. 工伤：员工因工负伤由个人写出书面报告，部门经理审核属实后，确定休养时间并签字后上报公司，公司按照具体情况承担相关费用。非因工负伤、患病或意外伤害，医疗费用保险机构赔偿部分外，其余部分自理，工资参照病假执行。", "block_bbox": [239, 1471, 2742, 1594], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1471.0], [2742.0, 1471.0], [2742.0, 1594.0], [239.0, 1594.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "-22", "block_bbox": [63, 1910, 122, 1941], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[63.0, 1910.0], [122.0, 1910.0], [122.0, 1941.0], [63.0, 1941.0]]}], "layout_det_res": 